        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global GLC Series Brushed Chrome  Commercial Door Levers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe GLC were designed for standard to light duty commercial applications. All locking functions are \r\n <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA compliant </b></a> (conform to A117.1 Barrier Free Accessibility Code) with push button locking. Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard with curved lip 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\" <a href=\"/products/ansi-strike-plate-global-glc-025-626\">ASA Strike Plate</a> (normally used on metal door frames). Optional curved lip 2-1/4\" X 1-1/4\" <a href=\"/products/full-lip-strike-plate-global-gla-026-626\">Full Lip Strike Plate</a> (normally used on wood door frames).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global GLC Series Commercial Door Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Standard 2-3/4\", Optional 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, Zinc dichromated resists corrosion, heavy duty spring cage.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: <a href=\"/products/commercial-asa-strike-plate-global-dl-ta001-us32d\">Standard ASA Strike Plate</a>,  Optional <a href=\"/products/full-lip-strike-plate-global-gla-026-626\">Full Lip Strike Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" throw <b>stainless steel</b>.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Empire Levers.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Standard SC1 solid brass Schlage \"C\" keyway (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6 pin cylinder keyed to 5 pins (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Warranty: <b>Lifetime Mechanical</b>. 10 Year on Finish</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/commercial-door-bore.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"376\" height=\"240\" border=\"0\" alt=\"commercial door bore hole diagram\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b><font color=\"red\">Warning Note:</font></b> This is a light commercial lever. They are <b>NOT for use</b> on commercial doors prepped  with Thru-bolt holes. (Thru-bolt holes pictured above). If your door has Thru-bolt holes use: <a href=\"/products/standard-commercial-leversets-global-gal-series\"><b> Standard Duty Commercial Levers</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet)(ANSI# F75): For interior doors that don't need locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bathroom or Bedroom)(ANSI# F76): For interior doors that could need locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Pushing inside turn-button locks outside lever. Unlock by turning inside lever, closing door or turning outside emergency slot.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry (ANSI# F109): For interior/exterior  doors that need security locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Pushing inside turn-button locks outside lever. Unlock by turning inside lever, closing door or using key outside. Pushing and turning inside turn-button keeps outside lever locked, key will retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Storeroom (ANSI# F86): For interior/exterior  doors that need security locking and/or emergency egress. Latchbolt operates by lever inside. Outside lever fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always unlocked. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Light Duty Brushed Chrome Commercial Leversets, Global GLC Series",
                "description": "Global GLC Series - ADA compliant Brushed Chrome door levers for light duty commercial and heavy duty residential. Available functions include Passage, Privacy, Entry and Storeroom. ",
